@startuml uc2_state
!include style.puml
left to right direction

title UC2 - Animation of an indicator over time (state of the player, 1975 to 2025)

state Idle
state Loading
state NoData
state Error

Loading : entry / request ALL years of the indicator in ONE call
Loading : entry / fix the colour scale for the whole period
NoData : no value for this indicator in the period
Error : back-end unavailable or invalid request

state Active {
  state Ready
  state Playing
  state Paused
  state Finished
  state checkEnd <<choice>>

  Ready : entry / currentYear = startYear, draw map
  Playing : entry / start timer
  Playing : exit / stop timer
  Finished : currentYear = endYear
}

Active : changeSpeed(s) / update the timer interval
Active : only recolour the map, geometry is never reloaded

[*] --> Idle : open the animation view

Idle --> Loading : selectIndicator(code, startYear, endYear)
Loading --> Loading : selectIndicator / cancel the previous request
Loading --> Ready : dataLoaded [at least one value]
Loading --> NoData : dataLoaded [no value]
Loading --> Error : loadFailed

NoData --> Loading : selectIndicator
Error --> Loading : retry
Error --> Loading : selectIndicator

Ready --> Playing : play
Playing --> Paused : pause
Paused --> Playing : play
Playing --> checkEnd : tick
checkEnd --> Playing : [currentYear < endYear]\n/ currentYear++, recolour map
checkEnd --> Finished : [currentYear = endYear]
Finished --> Playing : replay / currentYear = startYear

Ready --> Paused : scrub(year) / draw year
Playing --> Paused : scrub(year) / draw year
Finished --> Paused : scrub(year) / draw year
Paused --> Paused : scrub(year) / draw year

Active --> Loading : selectIndicator or changePeriod\n(leaves any inner state)

note bottom of Active
  Defaults: startYear = 1975, endYear = 2025.
  Colour scale is NOT recomputed per year,
  otherwise colours change meaning between frames.
end note

@enduml
